           The value should be the number of security bits of the  given  key.
           Bits of security is defined in SP800-57.

       "mandatory‐digest" (OOSSSSLL__PPKKEEYY__PPAARRAAMM__MMAANNDDAATTOORRYY__DDIIGGEESSTT) <UTF8 string>
